C LAB-FOCAL:  TITRAT  06/19/89
00.10 CODE TO SOLVE THE TITRATION PROBLEM

01.10 ZERO I,N
01.20 IF(2-LV=(50-1.5)/N=N+I=I+1).2
01.30 FOR J=I,-1,1; TYPE %4.02,V(J)=LV*J

02.10 Z I,N;U(LV=(50-1.5)/N=N+I=I+1,LE,2)
02.20 FOR J=I,-1,1; TYPE %4.02,V(J)=LV*J

03.10 Z I,N;U(LV=(50-1.5)/N=N+I=I+1,LE,2);N;F I=I,-1,1;T LV*I

04.10 Z I,N;U(LV=(50-1.5)/N=N+I=I+1,LE,2);N;U(I=I-1);T LV*(I+1)
